  m_text: In the year 2030 a corporation named Angel Corp released their newest technology
    called Resurrection. It was machine that can separate the soul from the body
    and preserve both until they need to be combined once again. 10 successful years
    later the riots began. The riots were caused by the people of God they were in
    the belief that this was blasphemy and should be destroyed. Corp was abandoned.
    Bodies and souls that were stored were left behind. Until the year 2081.
